# Firmware math: local notes only

Scanner math notes (Grade, Threshold, AFE, false echo, Orange, pick, mix, damping) live in:

`docs/firmware/` in **this** repository (`3DInstallGuide`).

Start: `docs/firmware/RESEARCH-CLOSED.md`

Layout: `README.md` (index) · `notes/` (logs) · `evidence/dumps/` · `evidence/traces/`

## Do not

- Edit `Documents\3D Emulator` for this work.
- Put formulas into `js/`, `css/`, `html`, `dist/` unless the user **this turn** names a guide file to change.
- `npm run build`, subtree push, or GitHub Pages for math-note work.

## Do

- Continue research by editing `docs/firmware/` here.
- Keep dumps cited as evidence; do not invent math.

## Guide UI (unrelated to math)

MultiVision chrome (menus, dialogs, layout) may still edit `js/`/`css` when the request is clearly UI and not Grade/echo/Orange math.
